<title>USA: Barnett Inc Q4 shr $0.12 with charge.</title>
<headline>Barnett Inc Q4 shr $0.12 with charge.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.12		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net			  1,945		    1,418</p>
<p> Net Sales		 33,996		   28,016</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  15,928		   15,928</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.55		    $0.47</p>
<p> Net			  7,158		    6,019</p>
<p> Net Sales		127,395		  109,106</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,914		   12,914</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: quarter and year ended June 30.</p>
<p>Three month and year end results include a one-time, non-cash charge of $0.7 million or $0.05 per share, from write-off of unamortized debt issuance costs incurred in connection with the company prepaying its borrowings with proceeds of its initial public offering completed April 3.</p>
